<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lafarge raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lafarge raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it had raised its rating for Lafarge Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Reston, Va., concrete and cement producer opened down 3/8 to 22-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
